            "raw_output": "downstream_apps/template/3_finetune_template_1D.py:151:            RegressionFlareModel,\ndownstream_apps/template/3_finetune_template_1D.py:152:            destandardize_channels,\ndownstream_apps/template/3_finetune_template_1D.py:156:        model = RegressionFlareModel(n_input_timestamps * n_channels)\ndownstream_apps/template/3_finetune_template_1D.py:157:        preprocess_fn = partial(destandardize_channels, channel_order=cfg.data.channels, scalers=scalers)\ndownstream_apps/template/1_baseline_template.ipynb:245:    \"from downstream_apps.template.models.simple_baseline import RegressionFlareModel\"\ndownstream_apps/template/1_baseline_template.ipynb:268:    \"# RegressionFlareModel only needs the flattened input dimension.\\n\",\ndownstream_apps/template/1_baseline_template.ipynb:269:    \"# It expects 'ts' in signum-log space \u2014 use destandardize_channels() before calling forward().\\n\",\ndownstream_apps/template/1_baseline_template.ipynb:270:    \"model = RegressionFlareModel(n_input_timestamps * n_channels)\\n\"\ndownstream_apps/template/1_baseline_template.ipynb:292:    \"from downstream_apps.template.models.simple_baseline import destandardize_channels\\n\",\ndownstream_apps/template/1_baseline_template.ipynb:296:    \"# RegressionFlareModel works in signum-log space, not normalized space.\\n\",\ndownstream_apps/template/1_baseline_template.ipynb:297:    \"# destandardize_channels undoes the per-channel z-score but KEEPS the log compression \u2014\\n\",\ndownstream_apps/template/1_baseline_template.ipynb:301:    \"batch_logspace = destandardize_channels(batch, channel_order=cfg.data.channels, scalers=scalers)\\n\",\ndownstream_apps/template/1_baseline_template.ipynb:477:    \"    destandardize_channels,\\n\",\ndownstream_apps/template/lightning_modules/pl_simple_baseline.py:104:        transformations (e.g., ``destandardize_channels``) without\ndownstream_apps/test/1_baseline_template.ipynb:245:    \"from downstream_apps.